<section class="auth-shell shell">
    <div class="auth-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Volvé a Nexo</span><h1>Tu sesión conecta la tienda con el backend.</h1><p>Ingresá para probar carrito, catálogo protegido y operaciones autenticadas.</p><div class="auth-points"><span>01 · Passport</span><span>02 · Session + MongoStore</span><span>03 · BCrypt</span></div></div>
    <div class="auth-card">
        <span class="eyebrow">Ingresar</span><h2>Bienvenido de nuevo.</h2>
        <form data-api-form data-endpoint="/api/session/login" data-success="/">
            <label>Email<input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required placeholder="tu@email.com"></label>
            <label>Contraseña<input type="password" name="password" autocomplete="current-password" minlength="6" required placeholder="••••••••"></label>
            <div class="form-links"><a href="/send-email">¿Olvidaste tu contraseña?</a></div>
            <button class="button button-primary button-wide" type="submit">Ingresar</button>
            <p class="form-status" data-form-status></p>
        </form>
        <a class="button button-ghost button-wide github-button" href="/api/session/github">Continuar con GitHub ↗</a>
        <p class="auth-switch">¿No tenés cuenta? <a href="/register">Creala acá</a></p>
    </div>
</section>
